    # ur "Thank you kindly, sir."
    ur "Muito obrigado, senhor."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1387
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_0ada23ff:

    # ur "It’s a pleasure to meet you."
    ur "É um prazer conhecê-lo."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1388
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_2a1d2438:

    # c "I guess he doesn’t have the sarcasm module yet?"
    c "Então você não instalou o modo de sarcasmo ainda?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1390
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_2b532d24:

    # th "Nope."
    th "Não."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1392
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_de873225:

    # th "URGH, please shut yourself down."
    th "AFF, por favor se desliga."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1394
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_a1820db6:

    # ur "Of course, madam."
    ur "Claro, senhora."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1396
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_d0a1743a:

    # "The robot rolled back against the wall and the lights on its chassis blinked out one by one."
    "O robô foi até a parede, e as luzes do seu chassi apagaram uma por uma."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1398
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_7254691b:

    # th "I’m starting to regret adding a speech module to that build."
    th "Estou começando a me arrepender de adicionar o módulo de fala."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1399
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_71d475fa:

    # c "But he’s such a charming fellow."
    c "Mas ele é tão charmoso."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1400
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_a0900c7e:

    # c "A little bit uptight, but still."
    c "Um pouco rígido demais, mas mesmo assim."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1402
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_8ed68978:

    # th "Uptight sounds mild."
    th "Rígido é pouco."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1403
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_60c20427:

    # th "He actually objected to me undressing when I first did that in his presence."
    th "Ele não gostou quando eu tirei a roupa na presença dele."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1404
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_727e2ecf:

    # c "Okay, so it’s a puritanical bore..."
    c "Beleza, então é um puritano chato..."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1405
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_e54cd966:

    # c "At least he has an off switch, which can’t be said for all loudmouthed prudes."
    c "Pelo menos dá para desligar, que é algo que não se pode falar dos moralistas mais vocais."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1407
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_84c56714:

    # th "Yes, although he tried to talk me out of it, the first time I tried to shut him down."
    th "É, mas ele tentou fazer eu mudar de ideia da primeira vez que tentei desligar ele."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1409
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_128d718e:

    # th "He began a long diatribe about the ethics of terminating synthetic life."
    th "Ele começou a mandar um logo discurso sobre a ética de acabar com a vida sintética."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1410
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_fd4a4e1d:

    # c "But you managed to convince him it was just something temporary?"
    c "Mas você conseguiu convencer ele que era só temporário?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1412
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_85f96c26:

    # th "Yes, in the end I did."
    th "Sim, no final eu consegui."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1413
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_df331d07:

    # th "But can you imagine being fucking mansplained by an angular hunk of metal?"
    th "Mas você tem ideia de como é receber explicação de uma pilha de metal?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1414
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_c9c0a58a:

    # c "Haven’t had the pleasure yet!"
    c "Ainda não tive o prazer!"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1416
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_7321e90f:

    # th "Annoying robot aside, I’m so very glad we got you back."
    th "Deixando o robô chato de lado, que bom que você está de volta."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1417
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_34f52d73:

    # th "I was busy the first weeks, you might have heard."
    th "Eu andei meio ocupada nas primeiras semanas, como já devem ter te avisado."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1419
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_d54e1a01:

    # th "But after we all got back on the Bastard everything that happened really sank in."
    th "Mas depois de todo mundo voltar para a Bastarda, foi aí que caiu a ficha."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1420
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_e3a8ac5b:

    # c "Yeah, I can’t imagine what it’s been like for you these past few weeks."
    c "É, não consigo imaginar deve ter sido para você nessas últimas semanas."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1421
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_ca91f06b:

    # c "Lilly told me you managed to cleanse the entirety of Petrarch?"
    c "A Lilly disse que vocês conseguiram fazer a limpa em Petrarch todo?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1423
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_6f89eedc:

    # th "Yes, we did."
    th "Sim, conseguimos."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1424
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_3351bc6c:

    # th "Petrarch appears to have been sparsely populated."
    th "Parece que Petrarch não tinha muita população."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1425
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_25a48138:

    # th "Once we knew where to look, the Bastard could only pick up a few signatures."
    th "Quando descobrimos onde procurar, a Bastarda só encontrou alguns sinais."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1426
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_b26c168e:

    # th "So after scorching the interior of the temple and the compound we were staying, we moved onto the other locations."
    th "Aí depois de queimar o interior do templo e a instalação onde a gente ficou, fomos para os outros locais."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1427
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_ed1c176a:

    # th "The temple was the largest structure on the planet."
    th "O templo era a maior estrutura do planeta."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1428
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_245d59a5:

    # th "All the other buildings we found were comparable in size to the compound we used as a base of operations."
    th "Todas as outras estruturas que encontramos eram mais ou menos do tamanho da que usamos como base de operação."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1429
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_e2c0b707:

    # th "It took us a few weeks to rig everything and after the detonations we visited each site to see if we got everything."
    th "Demoramos umas semanas para arrumar tudo. Depois das detonações, visitamos cada lugar para ver se explodimos tudo."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1430
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_9ec80cb9:

    # c "And did you?"
    c "E explodiram?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1431
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_45ce10af:

    # th "Yes, we managed to destroy everything."
    th "Sim, conseguimos destruir tudo."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1432
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_e2cf7eed:

    # th "Jade has assured us that no amount of computer forensics will be able to salvage anything in there."
    th "Jade garantiu que não existe computação forense o suficiente para recuperar alguma coisa dali."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1433
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_1371a9cc:

    # th "So all the records have been wiped."
    th "Então apagamos todos os registros."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1434
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_05cd1538:

    # c "Agust sure won’t be happy."
    c "Agust não vai ficar nada feliz."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1436
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_d04b2ea7:

    # th "No, he probably already isn’t."
    th "Não, provavelmente não."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1437
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_1a725ca0:

    # th "Céline left a few warning beacons when we pulled away from Petrarch."
    th "Céline deixou uns sinalizadores de aviso quando saímos de Petrarch."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1438
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_9992cb78:

    # c "Has one of those beacons been triggered?"
    c "Algum desses organizadores foi ativado?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1440
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_bc151139:

    # th "Yes, a week after we left, by a Sovereignty ship."
    th "Sim, umas semanas depois que saímos. Foi uma nave da Soberania."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1441
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_fcfce9bd:

    # c "Must have been them."
    c "Deve ter sido eles então."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1442
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_8083d00e:

    # th "Yes, because a few hours later, the same ship on an outbound trajectory was registered by another probe."
    th "Sim, porque algumas horas depois, a mesma nave apareceu uma sonda saindo do planeta."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1444
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_57b9d20c:

    # th "I guess they took their time to scan the planet’s surface and came back empty-handed."
    th "Acho que eles levaram um tempo escaneando o planeta e voltaram de mãos abanando."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1445
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_6f8f5fd7:

    # c "I wouldn’t want to be the captain of that ship."
    c "Eu não gostaria de ser o capitão daquela nave."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1447
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_3527b82e:

    # th "Me neither."
    th "Nem eu."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1448
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_26bb7527:

    # th "I guess a few heads will have rolled by now."
    th "Acho que a essa altura alguns já devem ter rodado."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1450
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_ce00d2a3:

    # th "Have you thought about what you’re going to do now?"
    th "Você já pensou no que vai fazer agora?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1451
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_9b6685c0:

    # c "Yes, I have."
    c "Sim, pensei."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1452
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_f70f80c1:

    # c "I’m going to bring the fight to the Sovereignty somehow."
    c "Vou trazer a luta até a Soberania de algum jeito."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1454
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_ba9a06cf:

    # th "Intriguing."
    th "Intrigante."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1455
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_7728df1f:

    # th "I’m game, whatever you do."
    th "Eu topo, seja o que for."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1456
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_9faad7ec:

    # th "Though getting revenge sounds like a good plan to me."
    th "Mas vingança parece um bom plano."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1457
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_3d97e7d1:

    # c "I’ll keep you in the loop."
    c "Eu vou te informar."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1460
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_da1cd697:

    # th "That would be great."
    th "Seria ótimo."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1461
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_f63dea1b:

    # th "Though if you don’t have any news, you’re always welcome here."
    th "Mas mesmo se não tiver notícia nenhuma, você é sempre bem-vindo aqui."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1462
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_c5b79d95:

    # th "I’m sure we can find a way to pass the time."
    th "Acho que a gente arruma algum jeito de passar tempo."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1463
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_31ee4375:

    # c "That sounds intriguing."
    c "Parece intrigante."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1464
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_f7670755:

    # c "Will URGH provide running commentary though?"
    c "Mas AFF ficar de comentarista?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1466
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_e28a0e69:

    # th "If you want to."
    th "Se você quiser."

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1468
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_4b3c6b5b:

    # th "It might enhance the mood?"
    th "Pode dar uma melhorada no clima?"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1469
translate portuguese ep023_thyia_talk_04b2dc15:

    # c "“Please sir, I must insist you refrain from inserting that meaty protuberance into madam’s lubricated borehole.”"
    c "“Por favor, senhor. Devo insistir que não insira esta protuberância carnuda no buraco lubrificado da madame.”"

# game/episode023_conversations.rpy:1470
